{"id":276,"date":"2024-10-19T02:36:08","date_gmt":"2024-10-19T02:36:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/westaucklandstorage.co.nz\/?p=276"},"modified":"2024-10-22T03:39:40","modified_gmt":"2024-10-22T03:39:40","slug":"span-farm-boat-yard-ltd-your-premier-boat-storage-solution-in-west-auckland","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/westaucklandstorage.co.nz\/span-farm-boat-yard-ltd-your-premier-boat-storage-solution-in-west-auckland\/","title":{"rendered":"Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd: Your Premier Boat Storage Solution in West AucklandWhy Choose West Auckland Storage?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re searching for reliable boat storage in West Auckland, look no further than Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd. We specialize in providing secure, convenient storage options for various watercraft, ensuring your vessel remains protected when not in use.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd?<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Span Farm Boat Yard, we understand the unique needs of boat owners. Our facility offers a range of services tailored to keep your boat safe and in excellent condition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>1. Uncovered Boat Storage<\/strong><br>Our uncovered storage spaces are perfect for those looking for cost-effective options. Enjoy easy access to your boat without the hefty fees of enclosed storage.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>2. Secure Environment<\/strong><br>Security is our top priority. With a monitored system and a resident manager on-site, you can trust that your vessel is safe 24\/7. Our facility is designed to protect your investment from theft and vandalism.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>3. Flexible Storage Options<\/strong><br>Whether you need short-term storage during the off-season or long-term solutions for your boat, we offer flexible leasing options. Choose from month-to-month agreements or take advantage of discounts for longer terms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>4. Ideal for All Boat Sizes<\/strong><br>Span Farm Boat Yard can accommodate boats up to 24 tonnes, making it suitable for everything from small trailer boats to larger yachts. Our spacious hardstand area allows for easy maneuvering and access.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Additional Services<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to boat storage, Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd offers various services to enhance your boating experience:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Slipway Access<\/strong>: Our slipway is currently under repair, but we provide facilities for launching trailer boats under 8m, making it easy to get on the water.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Future Hal-lout Facilities<\/strong>: Stay tuned for our upcoming hal-lout facilities, which will provide even more convenience for boat owners.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Storing Your Boat with Us<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Storing your boat at Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd provides numerous advantages:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Protection from Elements<\/strong>: Keep your boat safe from harsh weather conditions, UV rays, and falling debris.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maintenance Opportunities<\/strong>: With easy access, you can perform regular maintenance to keep your boat in top shape.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Peace of Mind<\/strong>: Knowing your boat is stored securely allows you to focus on enjoying your time on the water.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact Us Today!<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ready to secure your boat at Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd? Our team is here to assist you with all your storage needs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Get in Touch<\/strong><br>Call us at <strong>09-818 4586<\/strong> or email <strong><a>info@westaucklandstorage.co.nz<\/a><\/strong> for more information or to get a quote. Visit us soon and discover why we are the preferred choice for boat storage in West Auckland!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you&#8217;re searching for reliable boat storage in West Auckland, look no further than Span Farm Boat Yard Ltd. We [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":277,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"rank_math_lock_modified_date":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"var(--ast-global-color-4)","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","background-media":"","overlay-type":"","overlay-color":"","overlay-opacity":"","overlay-gradient":""},"tablet":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","background-media":"","overlay-type":"","overlay-color":"","overlay-opacity":"","overlay-gradient":""},"mobile":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","backgr